/-! # homfree-noemb, part 2: the T6 branch rerouted to fields that embed into `ℂ`

The open field `OpenTextbookLeaves13.homFreeFiniteAlgClosed` (Mumford §19 Thm 3 over every algebraically closed
field) reaches `sixContactMin_of_open38` only as `TextbookLeaves.t6 : PkgI3.HomFreeFinite`
(`t6 := t6_of_algClosed5 t.homFreeFiniteAlgClosed`, `textbookLeaves4_of_open6`). Every use of `t6` is at a field
that embeds into `ℂ` (`ℚ̄`, number fields, `AlgebraicClosure L'` for `L' ⊆ ℚ̄`). This module copies, verbatim up
to the renaming `X ↦ X_hf` / `XHF`, every declaration of `sixContactMin_of_open38`'s proof that depends on the
field or takes a bundle carrying it, with `PkgI3.HomFreeFinite` replaced by homfree-proof's `HomFreeFiniteC`
(T6 over fields `k` with a ring homomorphism `σ : k →+* ℂ`). A `σ` binder is added to the generic lemmas, and `σ`
is supplied at `ℚ̄` (`HFReroute.sigmaQbar`), at number fields (`HFReroute.sigmaNF`) and at algebraic closures
(`HFReroute.sigmaAlgClosure`). `HomFreeFiniteC` is proved (`homFreeFiniteC`) from `uniformizationLeafAll`
(proved, `uniformizationLeafAll_proof`) and the open field `mumfordTorsionAlgClosed`.

Result: `HDec.HSyn.sixContactMin_of_open38_hf` proves `ZInQ.SixContactMin` from the same bundles as
`sixContactMin_of_open38`, except that the textbook bundle is `OpenTextbookLeaves13HF`, i.e. `OpenTextbookLeaves13`
without `homFreeFiniteAlgClosed`. No new leaf. Generated by `scratch/homfree-noemb/gen/gen.py`. -/

